Honor wgpu's existing WGPU_BACKEND selection for native instances. Without the variable the original Vulkan+GL
mask remains unchanged. CPU-only CI can explicitly use Vulkan/Lavapipe, avoiding an unsupported GLES adapter probe
on a machine with no DRM device; errors are still reported, and native windows continue to be rendered and tested.
scripts/vendor-gpui.sh applies this to the verified crates.io archive after 0001 and 0002.

diff --git a/src/wgpu_context.rs b/src/wgpu_context.rs
--- a/src/wgpu_context.rs
+++ b/src/wgpu_context.rs
